From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Krishnakumar Valliappan <krishnavalliappan02@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:51:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(web): on-device Whisper dictation in the composer
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A Dictate button (lucide mic) next to Chat in the composer status bar, or
⌥⌘V, records from the mic; stopping transcribes with Whisper base.en in a
web worker (WebGPU, WASM fallback) and inserts the text into the composer.
Esc cancels. The model downloads from Hugging Face once and is cached; the
ONNX runtime is bundled instead of loaded from jsDelivr.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
